__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
sync.ffs*

# setuptools regenerates this on every `pip install -e .` — including the
# native venv install on containerHost's own host for scripts/login.py (see
# Login & Session Setup in Notion). Being tracked meant every such install
# left local modifications that blocked `git pull` on the Pi with "local
# changes would be overwritten by merge" (hit 2026-08-06) — same class of
# bug as the data/*.db-journal one below, generated/local files that were
# never meant to be committed in the first place.
src/nowplay.egg-info/

# Local data: sqlite db + saved login sessions (contain auth cookies — never commit)
# *.db-journal and the WAL-mode sidecars (*-wal/*-shm, connect() sets
# PRAGMA journal_mode = WAL — see db.py) weren't covered by `data/*.db`
# before (added 2026-08-06, after data/nowplay.db-journal turned up tracked
# and modified from a sandbox test run — see nowplay-project-instructions.md).
data/*.db
data/*.db-journal
data/*.db-wal
data/*.db-shm
data/*.json
!data/.gitkeep

sync.ffs*

.env
sync.ffs*